### VI. ABSOLUTE VOTING RESTRICTIONS AND ANTI-BYPASS PROVISIONS
* **Ownership and Origin Restrictions:** The modification, editing, manipulation, or alteration of voting data, vote counts, or voting mechanics is strictly prohibited. No user, licensee, or third party may edit or alter the votes unless they are the explicit repository owner (Licensor) or the action is executed natively through the official authorized website interface.
* **Absolute Anti-Bypass Clause:** The User is strictly prohibited from bypassing, circumscribed, or attempting to evade the established voting limitations, parameters, or restrictions on the monthly game vote. 
* **Prohibition of Technical Manipulation:** The creation, distribution, or utilization of any automated scripts, bots, scrapers, macros, token-spoofing methods, or anonymous API keys to interact with the voting mechanics is completely forbidden. 
* **Network and Identity Masking Banned:** The use of Virtual Private Networks (VPNs), proxy servers, Tor routing, IP rotation pools, browser fingerprinting alteration, or cookie-clearing automation specifically designed to mask identity or bypass the per-user/per-device monthly vote limits is an express violation of this agreement. 
* **Consequences of Violation:** Any attempt to artificially inflate, spam, manipulate, or bypass the official authorized interface to alter voting results constitutes a material breach of this Agreement. Any such action immediately voids all rights granted under this license *ab initio* (from the beginning) and will be treated as unauthorized system abuse and copyright infringement.

